Description: Touch scrolling resampled to the frame clock
 The touchscreen reports at 240 Hz and the display draws at 120 Hz; one scroll step per
 touch report gave each frame 0-3 reports of movement and a steady finger scrolled in uneven
 jumps. Like Android, each frame now scrolls to where the finger was 5 ms before it,
 interpolated between reports; offsets keep sub-pixel precision; the drag slop is not jumped.
Author: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no

